{"html": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"http://www.theunwindai.com\">\n    <img src=\"docs/banner/unwind_black.png\" width=\"900px\" alt=\"Unwind AI\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n# Awesome LLM Apps\n\n**100+ 오픈소스 AI 에이전트, agent skill, RAG 앱. 직접 만들고, 엔드투엔드로 테스트했고, Apache-2.0 라이선스입니다.**\n\n클론하고, 배포하고, 팔아도 됩니다 - 100% 무료이자 오픈소스\n\nClaude, Gemini, GPT, DeepSeek, Llama, Qwen 및 기타 오픈소스 모델과 함께 작동합니다.\n\n**[Unwind AI 단계별 튜토리얼](https://www.theunwindai.com)** · **[빠른 시작](#-run-one-now)** · **[모든 템플릿 둘러보기](#-browse-all-templates)**\n\n<a href=\"https://trendshift.io/repositories/9876\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://trendshift.io/api/badge/repositories/9876\" width=\"220\" alt=\"Trendshift에서 오늘의 #1 저장소로 소개됨\">\n</a>\n\n<br>\n\n</div>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"33.3%\" align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"agent_skills/project-graveyard/\"><img src=\"docs/gallery/project-graveyard.png\" alt=\"Project Graveyard: 죽은 사이드 프로젝트를 부검하는 에이전트\"></a>\n      <sub><b>Project Graveyard</b></sub>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"33.3%\" align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"voice_ai_agents/insurance_claim_live_agent_team/\"><img src=\"docs/gallery/insurance-claim-live-team.png\" alt=\"Insurance Claim Live Agent Team: 보험 청구를 실시간 음성으로 처리\"></a>\n      <sub><b>Insurance Claim Live Agent Team</b></sub>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"33.3%\" align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"advanced_ai_agents/single_agent_apps/ai_fraud_investigation_agent/\"><img src=\"docs/gallery/ai-fraud-investigation.png\" alt=\"AI Fraud Investigation Agent: 공공 기록을 교차 검증\"></a>\n      <sub><b>AI Fraud Investigation Agent</b></sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"agent_skills/self-improving-agent-skills/\"><img src=\"docs/gallery/self-improving-agent-skills.png\" alt=\"Self-Improving Agent Skills: eval을 기준으로 스스로를 재작성하는 스킬\"></a>\n      <sub><b>Self-Improving Agent Skills</b></sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"advanced_ai_agents/multi_agent_apps/ai_home_renovation_agent\"><img src=\"docs/gallery/ai-home-renovation.png\" alt=\"AI Home Renovation Agent: 사진을 넣으면 포토리얼리스틱한 리모델링 결과 출력\"></a>\n      <sub><b>AI Home Renovation Agent</b></sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"always_on_agents/always_on_hn_briefing_agent/\"><img src=\"docs/gallery/always-on-hn-briefing.png\" alt=\"Always-on HN Briefing Agent: 당신이 자는 동안 Hacker News를 대신 읽어줍니다\"></a>\n      <sub><b>Always-on HN Briefing Agent</b></sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n## 🚀 지금 하나 실행해 보기\n\n10초 만에 코딩 에이전트에 새로운 skill을 추가하세요:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps/tree/main/agent_skills/project-graveyard\n```\n\n그다음 이렇게 물어보세요: *\"내 사이드 프로젝트는 왜 끝까지 완성한 적이 없을까?\"*\n\n또는 클론 후 어떤 에이전트든 30초 안에 실행:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps.git\ncd awesome-llm-apps/starter_ai_agents/ai_travel_agent\npip install -r requirements.txt\nstreamlit run travel_agent.py\n```\n\n> 📬 새 템플릿이 매주 추가됩니다. [Unwind AI 뉴스레터로 받아보세요](https://www.theunwindai.com).\n\n## 🙏 스폰서에게 감사드립니다\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"16\" cellspacing=\"12\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://devtoolsacademy.link/shubham\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Vorflux\">\n        <img src=\"docs/banner/sponsors/vorflux.png\" alt=\"Vorflux\" width=\"500\">\n      </a>\n      <br>\n      <a href=\"https://devtoolsacademy.link/shubham\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #333; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;\">\n        Vorflux\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://sponsorunwindai.com/\" title=\"스폰서 되기\">\n        <img src=\"docs/banner/sponsor_awesome_llm_apps.png\" alt=\"Become a Sponsor\" width=\"500\">\n      </a>\n      <br>\n      <a href=\"https://sponsorunwindai.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #333; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;\">\n        스폰서 되기\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n> *(이하 원문 참조)*\n"}
